    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Cook pasta at a boil, stirring occasionally, until cooked through yet firm to the bite, about 12 minutes; drain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
