      ],
      "image": "assets/images/236715/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a saucepan over medium heat. Stir chicken broth, lemon juice, oregano, basil, and garlic into butter. Bring to a simmer and reduce heat to medium-low; cook until thickened to your desired texture, 5 to 7 minutes.",
